    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About the game</h2><br>Follow the days of a lonely writer, who dreams of writing her first book <br>and search for words of faith, perseverance and reflections on life.<br>The circumstances of everyday and trips to her favorite places will give <br>you all the inspiration needed to complete her desire.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><br>&quot;Life is like the wind, we are like leaves in the wind.<br>There is no way to know where the wind will blow<br>just as we cannot know where life will take us.<br>We can only resist the wind or get carried away by it. &quot;<br><br>The text above explains the purpose of this game.<br><br>Control a small leaf that is blown in several directions by the wind.<br>Your task is to collect various items scattered around the scenary that symbolize the<br>ideas and inspirations that the writer needs to complete her book.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Perform various maneuvers, dodge obstacles!</h2><br>Feel the wind blow in several directions, adapt to the circumstances.<br>Gain speed in free falls or fly downwind.<br>Control your acceleration by resisting and flying against the wind.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601040/extras/13c0f47c5eea4dc1f0e07dfc1f6cfb63.poster.avif?t=1629225989\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601040/extras/13c0f47c5eea4dc1f0e07dfc1f6cfb63.webm?t=1629225989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601040/extras/13c0f47c5eea4dc1f0e07dfc1f6cfb63.mp4?t=1629225989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
